verses: claims X and Y are metatruth-conditionally equivalent if there is a=
 predifferentiational Blobular universe such that there are differentiation=
 criteria that yield from it a postdifferentiational universe of which X is=
 true and there are differentiation criteria that yield from it a postdiffe=
rentiational universe of which Y is true.
